{"suttaId":"sn48.25","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[1227,1227],"vripara":"495"},"segments":{"sn48.25:0.3":"Suddhakasuttaṃ","sn48.25:1.1":"“Chayimāni, bhikkhave, indriyāni.","sn48.25:1.2":"Katamāni cha?","sn48.25:1.3":"Cakkhundriyaṃ, sotindriyaṃ, ghānindriyaṃ, jivhindriyaṃ, kāyindriyaṃ, manindriyaṃ – imāni kho, bhikkhave, cha indriyānī”ti.","sn48.25:1.5":"Pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-v","bookName":"Mahāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0305a.att","from":576,"to":576,"paras":[{"para":576,"vripara":"495-500","refs":["sn48.25:1"],"lines":["495-500. Pañcame cakkhu ca taṃ cakkhudvāre nibbattānaṃ dhammānaṃ ādhipateyyasaṅkhātena indaṭṭhena indriyañcāti <b>cakkhundriyaṃ.</b>","<b>Sotindriyā</b> dīsupi eseva nayo.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānameva.","Imasmiṃ vagge paṭhamasuttañceva chaṭṭhādīni ca pañcāti cha suttāni catusaccavasena kathitānīti."],"lineRefs":[["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn48.25:1.3","cakkhundriyaṃ",0,0],["sn48.25:1.3","sotindriyā",0,1]]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-v","bookName":"Mahāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0305t.tik","from":498,"to":501,"paras":[{"para":498,"vripara":"495-500","refs":["sn48.25:1"],"lines":["495-500. Yathā cakkhussa sahajātatadindriyanissitadhammesu adhipateyyaṃ anuvattanīyattā, evaṃ taṃdvārikadhammesupi adhipateyyaṃ tehi anuvattanīyattāti vuttaṃ –","<b>“adhipateyyasaṅkhātena indaṭṭhenā”</b>ti.","Esa nayo sesindriyādīsupi.","<b>Catusaccavasena kathitāni</b> sabhāvādivibhāvanassa kathitattā."],"lineRefs":[["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"],["sn48.25:1"]]},{"para":499,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Chaḷindriyavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":500,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sukhindriyavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":501,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn48.25:1"],"lines":["1-5. Suddhikasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn48.25:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]}}
